-- LAYER 1: section 2025(c)(1), the quality control system (fiscal incentives, tolerance level, liability amount, at-risk amount)
-- (7 U.S.C. 2025; lines 1933-1988 of usc07-ch51.txt, a converter's plain-text rendering, not the official text).
-- Money is a NUMBER of dollars; a rate or share is a fraction (6 percent is 0.06).
-- The percentage by which the thrifty food plan was adjusted (s 2012(u)(3)) is asked as a fraction (0.10 is 10 percent).
-- JUST TRUE / JUST FALSE / JUST n is what the text says, NOTHING is "not covered" (NOTES.md, Reading a result).

§ `s 2025(c)(1)(A) System`

-- src:1937 | In carrying out the supplemental nutrition assistance program, the Secretary shall carry out a system that enhances payment accuracy and improves administration by establishing fiscal incentives that require State agencies with high payment error rates to share in the cost of payment error.
@ref s 2025(c)(1)(A)(i) the system (src:1937)
GIVEN `the system enhances payment accuracy and improves administration` IS A BOOLEAN
      `it establishes fiscal incentives that require State agencies with high payment error rates to share in the cost of payment error` IS A BOOLEAN
GIVETH A MAYBE BOOLEAN
`s 2025(c)(1)(A)(i) the Secretary's quality control system is the system required` MEANS
    BRANCH
        IF `the system enhances payment accuracy and improves administration` AND `it establishes fiscal incentives that require State agencies with high payment error rates to share in the cost of payment error` THEN JUST TRUE
        -- FALSE-kind (the text says no in its own words): "the Secretary shall carry out a system that enhances payment accuracy and improves administration by establishing fiscal incentives"
        OTHERWISE JUST FALSE

-- src:1940 | (I) for fiscal year 2014, at an amount not greater than $37; and
@ref s 2025(c)(1)(A)(ii)(I) tolerance level for fiscal year 2014 (src:1940)
GIVEN `fiscal year` IS A NUMBER
      `the amount the Secretary sets, in dollars` IS A NUMBER
GIVETH A MAYBE BOOLEAN
`s 2025(c)(1)(A)(ii)(I) the tolerance level set is within the limit` MEANS
    BRANCH
        IF `fiscal year` EQUALS 2014 AND `the amount the Secretary sets, in dollars` AT MOST 37 THEN JUST TRUE
        -- FALSE-kind (the text says no in its own words): "for fiscal year 2014, at an amount not greater than $37"
        IF `fiscal year` EQUALS 2014 THEN JUST FALSE
        -- NOTHING-kind (limited by its own wording): subclause (I) speaks of fiscal year 2014 only
        OTHERWISE NOTHING

-- src:1941 | (II) for each fiscal year thereafter, the amount specified in subclause (I) adjusted by the percentage by which the thrifty food plan is adjusted under section 2012(u)(3) of this title between June 30, 2013, and June 30 of the immediately preceding fiscal year.
@ref s 2025(c)(1)(A)(ii)(II) tolerance level for each fiscal year thereafter (src:1941)
GIVEN `fiscal year` IS A NUMBER
      `the amount specified in subclause (I), in dollars` IS A NUMBER
      `s 2012(u)(3) the percentage by which the thrifty food plan was adjusted between the two dates` IS A NUMBER
GIVETH A MAYBE NUMBER
`s 2025(c)(1)(A)(ii)(II) the tolerance level for the fiscal year` MEANS
    BRANCH
        -- NOTHING-kind (limited by its own wording): "the amount specified in subclause (I)" is "an amount not greater than $37"
        IF `the amount specified in subclause (I), in dollars` GREATER THAN 37 THEN NOTHING
        IF `fiscal year` AT LEAST 2015 THEN JUST (`the amount specified in subclause (I), in dollars` TIMES (1 PLUS `s 2012(u)(3) the percentage by which the thrifty food plan was adjusted between the two dates`))
        -- NOTHING-kind (limited by its own wording): subclause (II) is for each fiscal year after fiscal year 2014
        OTHERWISE NOTHING

-- src:1944 | Not later than 180 days after December 20, 2018, the Secretary shall issue interim final regulations that—
@ref s 2025(c)(1)(B)(i) 180 days after December 20, 2018 (src:1944)
GIVETH A DATE
`s 2025(c)(1)(B)(i) the last day for the interim final regulations` MEANS
    (Date 20 12 2018) PLUS 180

@ref s 2025(c)(1)(B)(i) interim final regulations in time (src:1944)
GIVEN `date the regulations are issued` IS A DATE
GIVETH A MAYBE BOOLEAN
`s 2025(c)(1)(B)(i) the interim final regulations are issued in time` MEANS
    BRANCH
        IF `date the regulations are issued` AT MOST `s 2025(c)(1)(B)(i) the last day for the interim final regulations` THEN JUST TRUE
        -- FALSE-kind (the text says no in its own words): "Not later than 180 days after December 20, 2018, the Secretary shall issue interim final regulations"
        OTHERWISE JUST FALSE

-- src:1945 | (I) ensure that the quality control system established under this subsection produces valid statistical results;
-- src:1946 | (II) provide for oversight of contracts entered into by a State agency for the purpose of improving payment accuracy;
-- src:1947 | (III) ensure the accuracy of data collected under the quality control system established under this subsection; and
-- src:1948 | (IV) for each fiscal year, to the maximum extent practicable, provide for the evaluation of the integrity of the quality control process of not fewer than 2 State agencies, selected in accordance with criteria determined by the Secretary.
@ref s 2025(c)(1)(B)(i)(I)-(IV) what the regulations must do (src:1945-1948)
GIVEN `they ensure the quality control system produces valid statistical results` IS A BOOLEAN
      `they provide for oversight of contracts entered into by a State agency for the purpose of improving payment accuracy` IS A BOOLEAN
      `they ensure the accuracy of data collected under the quality control system` IS A BOOLEAN
      `number of State agencies whose quality control integrity they provide for the evaluation of each fiscal year, to the maximum extent practicable` IS A NUMBER
GIVETH A MAYBE BOOLEAN
`s 2025(c)(1)(B)(i) the interim final regulations have the content required` MEANS
    BRANCH
        IF `they ensure the quality control system produces valid statistical results`
            AND `they provide for oversight of contracts entered into by a State agency for the purpose of improving payment accuracy`
            AND `they ensure the accuracy of data collected under the quality control system`
            AND `number of State agencies whose quality control integrity they provide for the evaluation of each fiscal year, to the maximum extent practicable` AT LEAST 2
        THEN JUST TRUE
        -- FALSE-kind (the text says no in its own words): "the Secretary shall issue interim final regulations that"
        OTHERWISE JUST FALSE

-- src:1950 | In accordance with the nonprocurement debarment procedures under part 417 of title 2, Code of Federal Regulations, or successor regulations, the Secretary shall debar any person that, in carrying out the quality control system established under this subsection, knowingly submits, or causes to be submitted, false information to the Secretary.
@ref s 2025(c)(1)(B)(ii) debarment (src:1950)
GIVEN `the person is carrying out the quality control system` IS A BOOLEAN
      `the person knowingly submits, or causes to be submitted, false information to the Secretary` IS A BOOLEAN
GIVETH A MAYBE BOOLEAN
`s 2025(c)(1)(B)(ii) the Secretary shall debar the person` MEANS
